<title>FRANCE: Kingfisher seeks to buy But shares.</title>
<headline>Kingfisher seeks to buy But shares.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>British retailer Kingfisher said on Thursday its board had authorised talks on the possibility of buying shares in French firm  But at no more than 300 francs each from the Venturini family.</p>
<p>But the British firm added in a statement: &quot;To clear up any doubt, Kingfisher wants to state clearly that it is not certain that any transaction will go through, whether at this or another price&quot;.</p>
<p>Kingfisher also said it was looking into the conditions under which a guaranteed price offer could be made to minority holders if such a deal took place.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
